  title "The Void Matrix Assessment"
  summary "Shumei, a merchant-ledger warden, attempts to complete a routine magical assessment of artifact R5-X6XN6VK9, a Void Matrix, following standard Exchange procedures. When she begins direct observation and measurement, the artifact begins consuming aurora-light from the surrounding environment, spreading a zone of absolute darkness that extinguishes the magical glow of seven merchants and damages the entire Hearth Plaza's light-channeling system. Despite following all proper protocols and documentation procedures, Shumei's assessment triggers a catastrophic cascade that forces the artifact's permanent sealing in the deep vault and leaves her tasked with managing the bureaucratic and personal costs—including a grievance from the Pactum∴myster order and an ancestor's manifestation—that cannot be properly recorded in any ledger."
